PKG=zlib
NAME=zlib 1.2.13 - the deflate/inflate compression library
ARCH=Amiga
VERSION=1.2.13-2
CATEGORY=development
CLASSES=none
VENDOR=amix-packages
# PSTAMP is authored rather than left to pkgmk.  Unset, pkgmk stamps the package
# with <build-host-name><timestamp>, which leaks the build machine into a file
# meant for distribution.
PSTAMP=amix-packages-zlib-1.2.13-2
# The first zlib on Amix -- stock ships no libz at all.  Static archive; ship it
# under /opt/amix and add /opt/amix/lib to a consumer's -L (headers in
# /opt/amix/include).  gzprintf() uses the secure snprintf/vsnprintf path, whose
# symbols come from libacompat (link -lacompat -lc after -lz).
DESC=zlib 1.2.13 static compression library (libz.a) plus headers, under /opt/amix. The first zlib on Amix; rsync, wget and git link it. Ships /opt/amix/bin/zlib-test, an on-box acceptance check (crc32/adler32 canaries, a multi-MB deflate/inflate round trip, and inflate of a host-produced stream).
